# Gemma 4 E4B -- the FAST pick for the obsidian-llm-wiki plugin.
# ~4.5B EFFECTIVE params: Google positions its reasoning near their 26B model,
# but it runs at roughly 4B-model speed (2-4x faster than gemma3:12b). 128K
# context, English-native, fits 16GB with tons of headroom.
#
# Great fit here because the plugin grounds generation in YOUR notes
# (in-context), so reasoning + context size matter more than raw parametric
# knowledge -- which is where a small model would otherwise lose to a 12B.
#
# Build:  ollama create gemma-e4b-wiki -f gemma4-e4b.Modelfile
FROM gemma4:e4b

# Long context -- the plugin never sends num_ctx (Ollama defaults to ~4K).
# Lower this to 16384/8192 for even more speed while your wiki is still small.
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768

# Google's recommended Gemma sampling
PARAMETER temperature 1.0
PARAMETER top_k 64
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER min_p 0.0
